        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722680/extras/2067ece261b4e3ca829e55b872ac49fd.poster.avif?t=1757267801\" width=630 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722680/extras/2067ece261b4e3ca829e55b872ac49fd.webm?t=1757267801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722680/extras/2067ece261b4e3ca829e55b872ac49fd.mp4?t=1757267801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The Winter Mind is a visual novel about a girl who suffers from mental illness and goes to the store to buy groceries in the cold winter. She has lived her whole life with a voice in her head that accompanies her in this ordeal of going to the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is based on real events and was inspired by Milk inside a bag of milk inside a bag of milk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completion time</strong>: 10 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game has two endings</strong></p>",
